Basic Condition: integer are a, b and c. just 3 variables.
All the listed algorithms have a time complexity of O(1).

1(Independence):
max = a;

if (max < b){
  max = b;
}

if (max < c){
  max = c;
}

2(Clear expression):
if(a >= b && a >= c){
  max = a;
}

else if(b >= a && b >= c){
  max = b;
}

else{
  max = c;
}

3(Concise expression):
max = (a > b) ? a : b;
max = (max > c) ? max : c;
